iginal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tz/1q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"187EAC12-0124-4EA5-9E16-693BC800657B","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"それくらいですよねぇ","ts":"1632459286.293300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Syz+="}]},{"client_msg_id":"7304d98b-5f84-4cfd-9a54-9e015a107b1a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"必要としたらdenopsに依存するライブラリ(Denoのライブラリとして各プラグインでimportできる想定)の共有データを置いておく場所くらい？","ts":"1632458379.292900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ocQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1928140b-9ecd-469a-8b21-21c73c5f5d12","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ddcソースしか連携したことなくて本当に必要なケースに遭遇してないのであてにならなさそう","ts":"1632458271.290900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l/s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef282dcb-efad-4491-907e-0012766f8988","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"denops.dispatchで間に合ってしまってる","ts":"1632458238.290100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"270wF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86DF60C7-EF3B-4EA8-99CF-1C9008308F68","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"プラグイン間でデータを共有するためのグローバルストアが本当に必要か？って悩みですね","ts":"1632457186.289100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gntZu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cfc12303-6327-4661-a7a9-a4b2a112737a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、勘違いしていた\ndenops-bufferみたいなのを作るとしての話か\n\ndenopsの単体のプラグインでもglobal stateを管理する場合は\n\u0026gt; vim のデータに対してそこそこの計算量の処理を行いたく、さらにそれにキャッシュを噛ませたい\nに限るべきって話で読んじゃってました","ts":"1632457093.287400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"daJoT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EE8910F1-3332-4B60-A17A-400DA19CED33","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"たぶんycinoさんの話はプラグイン単体のキャッシュで済むので、グローバルストアは不要かと","ts":"1632457033.286300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0kg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"493eab40-826f-4bb0-9233-a342901f2996","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u0026gt; vim のデータに対してそこそこの計算量の処理を行いたく、さらにそれにキャッシュを噛ませたい\nに対して、自分はfzf-previewでいろいろとそれ以外の用途で使っている部分があるので、いいやり方があるなら気になるって文脈でした\n\nそもそもの話についての質問だったらすみません、そっちはdenops本体側でGlobal Stateを持って各プラグインが参照できる仕組みを導入するみたいな文脈かと思います","ts":"1632456898.285300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X6Wmf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdb82cf3-5ba2-4585-8d3b-4779b38f40bc","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"プラグイン単位のStateってことです？（勘違いだったらすいません","ts":"1632456745.282900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kjJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"414a330c-f255-46fd-82bb-10e166efee43","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分選択したコマンド名みたいなのにcallbackを紐付けているから、callback側でコマンド名を呼んで動的にcallbackを切り替えているのか","ts":"1632456692.281700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3nxu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78c3524c-0808-4c51-bacd-119414192303","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、これは多分例としてあまりよくないんですが、\nfzfはコマンド実行後に選択した要素に対してcallbackで（Vimレベルの）別のコマンドや関数を呼ぶみたいになっていて、fzf-previewではなんか理由があって（忘れてしまった）最初に呼び出したときに内部で色々やった変数をcallbackで読んでるんですよね","ts":"1632456562.280200","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1632456743.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0pI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a94d22e7-2381-4b38-a9f6-9f63839711a3","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"コマンドを実行した前回実行中の計算した値。というのはどういうものなんでしょうか。","ts":"1632456398.278200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bHcZC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1b883c1-0871-4e4e-b6dc-bd835f8c80a8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"全く分かってなくて質問なんですが、例えばコマンド実行を複数回したときに前回実行中に計算した値を参照したい場合とかってdenopsでどうやるのがいいんですかね？","ts":"1632456328.277800","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1632456350.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FXAc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e1065c5-6ba0-49ec-846e-6f02c329e52a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"vim はシングルトンだが、denops プラグインは複数の隔離された環境で動くので、共有キャッシュがないと上記を実現できない。","ts":"1632456185.276600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xSGjM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7213d391-5fe2-43a7-bb24-b1500e4258ab","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"バッファに対してどうこうする。以外はないと思われます。","ts":"1632456148.276000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mFhB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb001378-dc28-4b10-8c87-c4c6faf0ad5c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"想定用途は `vim のデータに対してそこそこの計算量の処理を行いたく、さらにそれにキャッシュを噛ませたい` というケースだけでしょうね。","ts":"1632456126.275600","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1632456137.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o1ps"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddd0813d-fbfc-46ff-b70b-7104ceb7aa43","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":":naruhodo: .","ts":"1632456077.274700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"85l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9e2d196-34bf-49d4-80be-eb3df712a1c1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとsessionみたいな概念を作って引き継いでるとかありますね","ts":"1632455724.274400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"grU+Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1d5c9bd-3a9b-4441-8531-93d9716cf8b0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Vim側のgloba